The '''Organization of Sukatic Nations''' ('''OSN''') is an intergovernmental organization comprising all the [[Sukatic peoples|Sukatic]] sovereign states on [[Basis]]: [[Afarut]], [[Gosaria]], [[Imendia]], [[Nykal]], [[Qym]] and [[Tamodia]]. 

The OSN has the aim of promoting stability and integration between [[Sukatic peoples]]. It is a forum for discussing regional strategic issues, based on the principles of shared ownership, shared decision-making and shared responsibility between different [[Sukatic peoples]]. U/C

